+To put a deterministic ceiling on child-agent execution, pass
+`max_team_calls_per_task=2` to `ManagerAgent`. Once that many worker calls have
+started during a manager task, further worker selections return a visible
+"Team delegation limit reached" observation without executing another worker;
+the manager can still use its other actions or finish. The quota resets for
+each task. The default `None` preserves existing delegation behavior. This
+controls the number of child calls, not their individual latency or token cost.
+
